fuzz/corpus
zstd/fuzz/corpus
# Ignore fresh fuzz crash artifacts by default — they pile up locally
# during `cargo fuzz run` sessions. Tracked regressions are whitelisted
# explicitly below so they ride along with their `tests/fuzz_regressions.rs`
# counterpart and stay reproducible from a clean checkout.
#
# NB: use the `**` pattern (NOT trailing-slash) on the parent. With
# `zstd/fuzz/artifacts/` git excludes the directory itself, which
# blocks any subsequent negation from re-including nested files.
# `zstd/fuzz/artifacts/**` matches children only, leaving the parent
# directory traversable.
zstd/fuzz/artifacts/**
!zstd/fuzz/artifacts/decode/
!zstd/fuzz/artifacts/decode/crash-*
!zstd/fuzz/artifacts/fse/
!zstd/fuzz/artifacts/fse/crash-*
!zstd/fuzz/artifacts/huff0/
!zstd/fuzz/artifacts/huff0/crash-*
!zstd/fuzz/artifacts/interop/
!zstd/fuzz/artifacts/interop/crash-*
.idea
/=
AGENTS.md
.claude/
.local/
**/__pycache__/
